sars.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Entrez dans la Cath\u00e9drale d'Archange.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Entrez par la porte principale.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le ma\u00eetre-autel ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "autel principal de l'\u00e9glise ; le lieu le plus sacr\u00e9 de celle-ci", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le ma\u00eetre-autel se trouve au milieu du ch\u0153ur.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous pouvez employer pour parler de la cath\u00e9drale.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la nef", "type": "name"}, {"content": "all\u00e9e principale de l'\u00e9glise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Cette cath\u00e9drale a trois nefs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le couronnement", "type": "name"}, {"content": "c\u00e9r\u00e9monie officielle o\u00f9 on place la couronne sur la t\u00eate d'un monarque ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le couronnement des tsars a eu lieu dans cette cath\u00e9drale.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la  coupole ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "d\u00f4me", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Les coupoles sont toutes en or !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le02ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sombre", "type": "name"}, {"content": "peu \u00e9clair\u00e9 ; noir ; obscur ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "